cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use needtoknow in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "needtoknow: permission-aware retrieval for RAG"
abstract: >-
  A Python library that makes retrieval-augmented generation respect permissions: every user gets
  only the chunks they are allowed to read, whatever vector store, permission system or framework
  is used. Permission filters run inside the vector search when the permission system can express
  them, candidates are checked after the search when it cannot, and every failure fails closed.
authors:
